  "details": "Today, when i am playing in VRChat for a while, and suddenly the area is black. I heard short beep when i want start write in air.\n\nWhen i close SteamVR and restart it, the automatic login of VRChat is not more and i got just standard login like new user, with both VRChat/Stream login buttons.\n\nI checked in discord if someone is still in VRChat. Indeed, others have no problems.\n\nBut it looks very much like 'server crash' because the login is not working.\n\nAnd does VRChat really 'forgot' my login or it's indeed server problem? You may tell what happened here exactly.\n\nUsing standard SteamVR, no Beta option.",
